      "text": "<think>\nI need to find the sum of 87,772,8158 and 797,271,052. However, I notice that the numbers are written with commas, which might indicate different digit groupings. To ensure accuracy, I'll treat each number as a whole without the commas.\n\nFirst, I'll add 87,772,8158 and 797,271,052. Adding these together gives me 1,685,043,170.\n\nNext, I'll add 1,685,043,170 to 797,271,052. This results in a total of 2,482,314,222.\n</think>\n\nTo find the sum of **87,772,8158** and **797,271,052**, we'll follow these steps:\n\n1. **Add the two numbers together:**\n\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n&\\phantom{+}87,\\!772,\\!8158 \\\\\n&+797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n\\hline\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\\!772,\\!8158 + 797,\\!271,\\!052 \\\\\n&= 87,\