      "text": "<think>\nI need to find the sum of 577,878,174 and 358,761,354.\n\nFirst, I'll add the two numbers together.\n\nAdding the units place: 4 + 4 = 8.\n\nNext, the tens place: 7 + 5 = 12. I'll write down 2 and carry over 1.\n\nThen, the hundreds place: 1 + 3 + 1 (carry) = 5.\n\nContinuing this way for each digit place, I'll perform the addition step by step.\n\nAfter adding all the digits, I'll combine the results to get the final sum.\n</think>\n\nTo find the sum of **577,878,174** and **358,761,354**, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Write down the numbers:**\n   \n   \\[\n   \\begin{align*}\n   &\\phantom{+}577,\\!878,\\!174 \\\\\n   +&\\phantom{+}358,\\!761,\\!354 \\\\\n   \\hline\n   &= \\text{?}\n   \\end{align*}\n   \\]\n\n2. **Add the numbers digit by digit from right to left:**\n\n   - **Units place:**\n     \\[\n     4 + 4 = 8\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Tens place:**\n     \\[\n     7 + 5 = 12 \\quad (\\text{write down } 2, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Hundreds place:**\n     \\[\n     1 + 3 + 1 = 5\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Thousands place:**\n     \\[\n     8 + 6 = 14 \\quad (\\text{write down } 4, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Ten-thousands place:**\n     \\[\n     7 + 7 + 1 = 15 \\quad (\\text{write down } 5, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Hundred-thousands place:**\n     \\[\n     8 + 6 + 1 = 15 \\quad (\\text{write down } 5, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Millions place:**\n     \\[\n     7 + 5 + 1 = 13 \\quad (\\text{write down } 3, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Ten-millions place:**\n     \\[\n     5 + 8 + 1 = 14 \\quad (\\text{write down } 4, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Hundred-millions place:**\n     \\[\n     7 + 3 + 1 = 11 \\quad (\\text{write down } 1, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Billions place:**\n     \\[\n     5 + 3 + 1 = 9\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Ten-billions place:**\n     \\[\n     5 + 3 = 8\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Hundred-billions place:**\n     \\[\n     5 + 3 = 8\n     \\]\n   \n   - **Trillions place:**\n     \\[\n     5 + 3 = 8\n     \\]\n   \n3. **Combine all the results:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{align*}\n   &\\phantom{+}577,\\!878,\\!174 \\\\\n   +&\\phantom{+}358,\\!761,\\!354 \\\\\n   \\hline\n   &= 936,\\!639,\\!528\n   \\end{align*}\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{936639528}\n\\]",
