  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "<think>\nI need to find the sum of 728,931,477 and 913,273,174.\n\nFirst, I'll add the two numbers together.\n\nAdding the units place: 7 + 4 = 11. I'll write down 1 and carry over 1.\n\nNext, adding the tens place: 7 + 7 = 14, plus the carried over 1 makes 15. I'll write down 5 and carry over 1.\n\nContinuing this process for each digit place, I'll add the corresponding digits from both numbers and include any carry-over from the previous addition.\n\nAfter adding all the digits, I'll combine the results to get the final sum.\n</think>\n\nTo find the sum of **728,931,477** and **913,273,174**, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Write down the numbers:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{align*}\n   &\\phantom{+}728,\\!931,\\!477\\\\\n   +&913,\\!273,\\!174\\\\\n   \\hline\n   &=?\n   \\end{align*}\n   \\]\n\n2. **Add the numbers digit by digit from right to left:**\n\n   - **Units place:**  \n     \\(7 + 4 = 11\\)  \n     Write down **1** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Tens place:**  \n     \\(7 + 7 = 14\\), plus the carried over **1** makes **15**.  \n     Write down **5** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Hundreds place:**  \n     \\(4 + 3 = 7\\), plus the carried over **1** makes **8**.  \n     Write down **8**.\n\n   - **Thousands place:**  \n     \\(1 + 2 = 3\\), plus any carry-over (if any).  \n     Write down **3**.\n\n   - **Ten-thousands place:**  \n     \\(3 + 7 = 10\\), plus any carry-over.  \n     Write down **0** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Hundred-thousands place:**  \n     \\(9 + 3 = 12\\), plus the carried over **1** makes **13**.  \n     Write down **3** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Millions place:**  \n     \\(8 + 2 = 10\\), plus the carried over **1** makes **11**.  \n     Write down **1** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Ten-millions place:**  \n     \\(2 + 1 = 3\\), plus the carried over **1** makes **4**.  \n     Write down **4**.\n\n   - **Hundred-millions place:**  \n     \\(7 + 9 = 16\\), plus any carry-over.  \n     Write down **6** and carry over **1**.\n\n   - **Billions place:**  \n     \\(6 + 1 = 7\\), plus the carried over **1** makes **8**.\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{align*}\n   &\\phantom{+}728,\\!931,\\!477\\\\\n   +&913,\\!273,\\!174\\\\\n   \\hline\n   &=1,\\!642,\\!204,\\!651\n   \\end{align*}\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1642204651}\n\\]",
